  "excerpt": "Short summary:\nOur students got hands-on in the kitchen through the Cook for Life programme, learning about nutrition, healthy food choices and cooking skills while making some delicious nachos.",
  "title": "“Did you not tell him they are the Lord’s chips?” 😂",
  "body": "Today we welcomed the **Nestlé team** to Rosehill College to work with some of our students through the **Cook for Life programme**.\n\nOur students learned about nutrition and healthy food choices, then got hands-on in the kitchen and put their skills to work. The result? Some very tasty nachos! 🙌\n\nA big thank you to the Nestlé team for supporting our young people to build their cooking confidence and learn practical skills they can take home and share with their whānau. 💚",
